{
  "description": "Bullet holes and casings: in a live round alice sprays The Prompt at a wall, then at the floor: holes stay where the rays stopped (a dark pit, a scorched ring, chipped dust), brass casings arc out to her right and lie on the floor (bob, beside her, sees her holes and casings too, from the server's shot relay). When round 2 starts all of it is gone",
  "clients": ["alice", "bob"],
  "steps": [
    {"client": "*", "call": "time", "args": [40]},
